NOTE ON NMAP

This project is an independent, from-scratch reimplementation written for
educational purposes. It reproduces *algorithms and constants* documented in
Nmap's publicly available source code (RTT estimation, AIMD congestion
control parameters, and the errno/ICMP-to-port-state decision tables), with
references to the originating files and line numbers given in the source
comments and in docs/.

No Nmap source code has been copied into this repository, and no Nmap data
files (such as nmap-services) are redistributed here.

Nmap is distributed under the Nmap Public Source License (NPSL). See
https://nmap.org/npsl/ for its terms. Nmap is a registered trademark of the
Nmap Project; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by it.
